{"seq":2,"slug":"cache-optimization","title":"CPU 缓存优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/cpu-optimization/cache-optimization","wordCount":1336,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"cpu-缓存优化\">CPU 缓存优化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CPU 缓存是位于 CPU 和主内存之间的高速存储层，弥补了处理器速度和内存速度之间数量级的差距。现代 CPU 通常有三级缓存（L1/L2/L3），访问延迟从 1 纳秒到 10 纳秒不等，而主内存访问延迟约 100 纳秒。这意味着<strong>一次缓存未命中的代价相当于几十到上百个 CPU 周期的等待</strong>。对于数据密集型应用，缓存命中率往往比算法复杂度更决定实际性能。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[CPU 核心] --&gt;|1 ns| B[L1 Cache 32-64KB]&#10;    B --&gt;|3-5 ns| C[L2 Cache 256KB-1MB]&#10;    C --&gt;|10-20 ns| D[L3 Cache 8-64MB]&#10;    D --&gt;|60-100 ns| E[主内存 DDR4/DDR5]&#10;    E --&gt;|10-100 μs| F[SSD/NVMe]\">graph LR\n    A[CPU 核心] --&gt;|1 ns| B[L1 Cache 32-64KB]\n    B --&gt;|3-5 ns| C[L2 Cache 256KB-1MB]\n    C --&gt;|10-20 ns| D[L3 Cache 8-64MB]\n    D --&gt;|60-100 ns| E[主内存 DDR4/DDR5]\n    E --&gt;|10-100 μs| F[SSD/NVMe]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓存层级</th>\n<th>典型大小</th>\n<th>访问延迟</th>\n<th>特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 数据缓存</td>\n<td>32-64 KB/核</td>\n<td>~1 ns (4 cycles)</td>\n<td>每核独享，最快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1 指令缓存</td>\n<td>32-64 KB/核</td>\n<td>~1 ns</td>\n<td>存储已解码的指令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 缓存</td>\n<td>256 KB - 1 MB/核</td>\n<td>~5 ns (12 cycles)</td>\n<td>每核独享或两核共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 缓存</td>\n<td>8-64 MB</td>\n<td>~15 ns (40 cycles)</td>\n<td>所有核心共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主内存</td>\n<td>GB 级别</td>\n<td>~100 ns (200+ cycles)</td>\n<td>所有核心共享</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"缓存行与空间局部性\">缓存行与空间局部性</h2><p>CPU 缓存以<strong>缓存行</strong>（Cache Line）为最小读写单位，通常为 64 字节。当 CPU 需要读取一个 4 字节的 int 变量时，它实际上会将包含这个变量的整个 64 字节缓存行都加载进来。这个设计利用了<strong>空间局部性</strong>（Spatial Locality）——程序访问了某个地址后，很可能会接着访问附近的地址。</p>\n<p>理解缓存行大小对数据结构设计有直接影响。考虑遍历数组和遍历链表的性能差异：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"#define N 10000000&#10;&#10;struct ArrayData {&#10;    int values[N];&#10;};&#10;&#10;struct Node {&#10;    int value;&#10;    struct Node *next;&#10;};&#10;&#10;void sum_array(struct ArrayData *data) {&#10;    long sum = 0;&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; N; i++) {&#10;        sum += data-&gt;values[i];  // 每 16 次访问才触发 1 次缓存未命中&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;void sum_linked_list(struct Node *head) {&#10;    long sum = 0;&#10;    struct Node *curr = head;&#10;    while (curr) {&#10;        sum += curr-&gt;value;  // 每次访问可能都触发缓存未命中&#10;        curr = curr-&gt;next;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#define</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> N</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ArrayData {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[N];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Node {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sum_array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ArrayData </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> N; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data->values[i];</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 每 16 次访问才触发 1 次缓存未命中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sum_linked_list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">curr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (curr) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> curr->value;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 每次访问可能都触发缓存未命中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        curr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> curr->next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>数组遍历每次缓存行加载（64 字节）可以满足 16 个 int（4 字节）的后续访问，缓存未命中率约 1/16。而链表节点如果在内存中随机分布，每次访问都可能触发缓存未命中。这就是为什么相同算法复杂度下，数组比链表快得多——本质上是缓存友好性的差异。</p>\n<p><strong>结构体填充与对齐</strong>也与缓存行密切相关。编译器会在结构体成员之间插入填充字节以满足对齐要求。不恰当的成员排列会导致结构体占用更多的缓存行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"struct BadLayout {&#10;    char a;       // 1 byte + 7 padding&#10;    double b;     // 8 bytes&#10;    char c;       // 1 byte + 3 padding&#10;    int d;        // 4 bytes&#10;};               // Total: 24 bytes (跨多缓存行)&#10;&#10;struct GoodLayout {&#10;    double b;     // 8 bytes&#10;    int d;        // 4 bytes&#10;    char a;       // 1 byte&#10;    char c;       // 1 byte + 2 padding&#10;};               // Total: 16 bytes (更紧凑)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BadLayout {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 1 byte + 7 padding</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     // 8 bytes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 1 byte + 3 padding</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 4 bytes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               // Total: 24 bytes (跨多缓存行)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GoodLayout {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     // 8 bytes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 4 bytes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 1 byte</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 1 byte + 2 padding</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               // Total: 16 bytes (更紧凑)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"时间局部性与热数据分离\">时间局部性与热数据分离</h2><p><strong>时间局部性</strong>（Temporal Locality）是指最近访问的数据很可能在短时间内再次被访问。优化时间局部性的核心策略是将<strong>热数据</strong>（频繁访问的数据）和<strong>冷数据</strong>（很少访问的数据）分离存放，让热数据能够持续驻留在缓存中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"struct HotCold_Bad {&#10;    int id;              // 热: 每次查询都需要&#10;    float score;         // 热: 排序/过滤时频繁访问&#10;    char name[64];       // 冷: 只在显示时需要&#10;    char description[256]; // 冷: 很少访问&#10;    int category;        // 热: 过滤条件&#10;    long last_updated;   // 冷: 偶尔访问&#10;};&#10;&#10;struct HotData {&#10;    int id;&#10;    float score;&#10;    int category;&#10;};&#10;&#10;struct ColdData {&#10;    char name[64];&#10;    char description[256];&#10;    long last_updated;&#10;};&#10;&#10;struct HotCold_Good {&#10;    struct HotData *hot;   // 紧凑的热数据数组&#10;    struct ColdData *cold; // 按需加载的冷数据&#10;    size_t count;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HotCold_Bad {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              // 热: 每次查询都需要</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         // 热: 排序/过滤时频繁访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 冷: 只在显示时需要</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 冷: 很少访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 热: 过滤条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_updated;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 冷: 偶尔访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HotData {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ColdData {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_updated;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HotCold_Good {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HotData </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">hot;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 紧凑的热数据数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ColdData </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cold;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 按需加载的冷数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    size_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种<strong>SoA</strong>（Structure of Arrays）模式在游戏引擎和数据库引擎中广泛使用。将同类型的热字段打包到连续数组中，遍历时每次缓存行加载都是有效数据，不会被冷字段&quot;浪费&quot;空间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph AoS 模式 - Array of Structures&#10;        A1[id,score,name,desc,cat] --&gt; A2[id,score,name,desc,cat] --&gt; A3[...]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph SoA 模式 - Structure of Arrays&#10;        B1[id,id,id,...] --&gt; C1[连续内存,缓存友好]&#10;        B2[score,score,score,...] --&gt; C1&#10;        B3[name,name,name,...] --&gt; C2[按需加载]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph AoS 模式 - Array of Structures\n        A1[id,score,name,desc,cat] --&gt; A2[id,score,name,desc,cat] --&gt; A3[...]\n    end\n    subgraph SoA 模式 - Structure of Arrays\n        B1[id,id,id,...] --&gt; C1[连续内存,缓存友好]\n        B2[score,score,score,...] --&gt; C1\n        B3[name,name,name,...] --&gt; C2[按需加载]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"伪共享与缓存一致性\">伪共享与缓存一致性</h2><p>在多核 CPU 中，每个核心有独立的 L1/L2 缓存。当两个核心修改同一缓存行中的不同变量时，会触发<strong>伪共享</strong>（False Sharing）——缓存一致性协议（如 MESI）会在核心之间反复传递缓存行的所有权，即使两个核心操作的是完全独立的数据。伪共享可以导致 10 倍以上的性能下降。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"struct CounterBad {&#10;    long counter_a;  // 核心 0 频繁写入&#10;    long counter_b;  // 核心 1 频繁写入&#10;    // 两个 long（16 字节）在同一个 64 字节缓存行中 → 伪共享!&#10;};&#10;&#10;#define CACHE_LINE_SIZE 64&#10;&#10;struct CounterGood {&#10;    long counter_a;&#10;    char padding_a[CACHE_LINE_SIZE - sizeof(long)];  // 填充至独立缓存行&#10;    long counter_b;&#10;    char padding_b[CACHE_LINE_SIZE - sizeof(long)];&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CounterBad {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counter_a;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 核心 0 频繁写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counter_b;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 核心 1 频繁写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 两个 long（16 字节）在同一个 64 字节缓存行中 → 伪共享!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#define</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CACHE_LINE_SIZE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CounterGood {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counter_a;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> padding_a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[CACHE_LINE_SIZE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)];</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 填充至独立缓存行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counter_b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> padding_b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[CACHE_LINE_SIZE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Java 中，可以使用 <code>@Contended</code> 注解来自动避免伪共享：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"import sun.misc.Contended;&#10;&#10;public class PaddedCounter {&#10;    @Contended&#10;    volatile long counterA;&#10;&#10;    @Contended&#10;    volatile long counterB;&#10;}&#10;// 需要 JVM 参数: -XX:-RestrictContended\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sun.misc.Contended;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaddedCounter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Contended</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counterA;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Contended</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counterB;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 需要 JVM 参数: -XX:-RestrictContended</span></span></code></pre></div><p>检测伪共享的方法是使用 <code>perf c2c</code>（cache-to-cache）工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"perf c2c record -g -- ./myapp&#10;perf c2c report --stdio&#10;# 关注 &quot;Shared Data Cache Line Table&quot; 中 HITM（跨核命中）比例高的缓存行\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> c2c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> c2c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> report</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --stdio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 关注 \"Shared Data Cache Line Table\" 中 HITM（跨核命中）比例高的缓存行</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"预取策略与缓存污染\">预取策略与缓存污染</h2><p>CPU 有硬件预取器（Hardware Prefetcher），能够检测到顺序访问模式并提前加载后续缓存行。但对于不规则的访问模式（如哈希表查找、树遍历），硬件预取器无法有效工作。此时可以使用<strong>软件预取</strong>指令手动提示 CPU：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"#include &lt;xmmintrin.h&gt;&#10;&#10;void sum_with_prefetch(int *data, int n) {&#10;    long sum = 0;&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;        _mm_prefetch(&amp;data[i + 16], _MM_HINT_T0);  // 提前 16 个元素预取&#10;        sum += data[i];&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;void hash_lookup_with_prefetch(HashTable *ht, int *keys, int n) {&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n - 4; i++) {&#10;        size_t hash = hash_function(keys[i + 4]);&#10;        _mm_prefetch(&amp;ht-&gt;buckets[hash], _MM_HINT_T0);&#10;&#10;        process(ht, keys[i]);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;xmmintrin.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sum_with_prefetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        _mm_prefetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], _MM_HINT_T0);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 提前 16 个元素预取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hash_lookup_with_prefetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(HashTable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ht</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        size_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hash_function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        _mm_prefetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ht->buckets[hash], _MM_HINT_T0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ht, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>与预取相对的问题是<strong>缓存污染</strong>（Cache Pollution）——将大量不会被重用的数据加载进缓存，把真正有用的热数据挤出去。典型场景是扫描大数组时会把整个 L3 缓存刷掉。解决方法包括使用 <code>_MM_HINT_NTA</code>（Non-Temporal Access）提示数据不需要缓存，或者使用非临时存储指令 <code>_mm_stream_si128</code> 绕过缓存直接写入内存。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预取提示</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>_MM_HINT_T0</td>\n<td>预取到所有缓存层级</td>\n<td>很快会多次访问的数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>_MM_HINT_T1</td>\n<td>预取到 L2 和 L3</td>\n<td>中等频率访问的数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>_MM_HINT_T2</td>\n<td>预取到 L3</td>\n<td>低频访问的数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>_MM_HINT_NTA</td>\n<td>非临时预取，尽量不污染缓存</td>\n<td>流式扫描，只访问一次</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((缓存优化))&#10;    缓存层次&#10;      L1/L2/L3&#10;      访问延迟差异&#10;      缓存行 64B&#10;    空间局部性&#10;      数组 vs 链表&#10;      结构体对齐&#10;      SoA vs AoS&#10;    时间局部性&#10;      热冷数据分离&#10;      工作集大小&#10;    伪共享&#10;      多核缓存一致性&#10;      缓存行填充&#10;      perf c2c 检测&#10;    预取与污染&#10;      硬件预取&#10;      软件预取指令&#10;      非临时访问\">mindmap\n  root((缓存优化))\n    缓存层次\n      L1/L2/L3\n      访问延迟差异\n      缓存行 64B\n    空间局部性\n      数组 vs 链表\n      结构体对齐\n      SoA vs AoS\n    时间局部性\n      热冷数据分离\n      工作集大小\n    伪共享\n      多核缓存一致性\n      缓存行填充\n      perf c2c 检测\n    预取与污染\n      硬件预取\n      软件预取指令\n      非临时访问</pre><ul>\n<li>CPU 缓存未命中是数据密集型应用的首要性能杀手，<strong>一次 L3 未命中 ≈ 200 个 CPU 周期的等待</strong></li>\n<li>以<strong>缓存行</strong>（64 字节）为单位思考数据布局，紧凑排列热数据，按照访问模式组织内存</li>\n<li><strong>SoA 模式</strong>（Structure of Arrays）在批量遍历场景下远优于 AoS，是高性能数据处理的标准模式</li>\n<li><strong>伪共享</strong>是多核编程中的隐蔽杀手，通过缓存行对齐填充或 <code>@Contended</code> 注解来避免</li>\n<li><strong>软件预取</strong>可以弥补硬件预取器在不规则访问模式下的不足，但需要谨慎使用避免缓存污染</li>\n<li>优化缓存友好性通常比优化算法复杂度有更直接的性能收益——常数因子往往决定实际表现</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CPU 缓存优化","id":"cpu-缓存优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存行与空间局部性","id":"缓存行与空间局部性"},{"level":2,"text":"时间局部性与热数据分离","id":"时间局部性与热数据分离"},{"level":2,"text":"伪共享与缓存一致性","id":"伪共享与缓存一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"预取策略与缓存污染","id":"预取策略与缓存污染"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"性能剖析工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/cpu-optimization/profiling-tools"},"next":{"title":"分支预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/cpu-optimization/branch-prediction"}}